// webview.js — the 👀 PREVIEW card. SIMPLE: Clappy (the clapperboard) opens a file picker; the
// picked file caches in window.SANDBOX and opens as a BLACK TAB over the curtain (name + a curtain
// close icon). closing a tab draws the curtain — removes that file from the sandbox cache. a 🖨️
// printer on the RIGHT exports the open tab: html · original · print (the native dialog handles
// pdf too — print or save-as-pdf). html runs in a sandboxed iframe; images show; else a cached note.

